column and a \code{label} column.

When \code{label_placement} is \code{"inside"}, each label takes black or white by
whichever contrasts better with its swatch, so a \code{color} in \code{label_style} is
ignored in that mode.

\code{\link[=gt_title_header]{gt_title_header()}} and anything else calling \code{gt::tab_header()} replaces the
whole header. With \code{location = "top"}, add those first or they will overwrite
